        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>古诗三首 —— 绝句 · 惠崇春江晚景</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fdf9f2;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf9f2;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 20px 24px 40px 24px;\n  }\n\n  /* 手写红色批注 */\n  .handwriting {\n    color: #e8352b;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    width: 300px;\n    margin: 8px 0 0 34px;\n  }\n\n  /* 单元标题（被批注遮挡） */\n  .unit-title {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 62px;\n    left: 258px;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    color: #6b6b63;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n\n  /* 主体两栏 */\n  .main {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 300px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    width: 190px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* 诗歌 */\n  .poem-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .poem-title2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .author {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #333;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .poem-body {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 2.15;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    margin-left: 62px;\n  }\n  .py {\n    display: inline-block;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .py rt, ruby rt {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #444;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  sup {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    vertical-align: super;\n  }\n\n  /* 注释框 */\n  .note-box {\n    border: 1px solid #cfcabd;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .note-box .nb-title {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .note-box ol {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n  .note-box ol li {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* 红色手绘方框 */\n  .red-frame {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 108px;\n    left: 316px;\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 448px;\n    border: 3px solid #e8352b;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  /* 重点二字 */\n  .keypoint {\n    color: #e8352b;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin: 34px 0 30px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* 学习伙伴气泡 */\n  .bubble {\n    width: 132px;\n    background: #fdf3d6;\n    border: 1px solid #e6d9a8;\n    border-radius: 50%/40%;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    margin: 12px 0 0 240px;\n  }\n\n  /* 图片占位 */\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #b9b2a2;\n    color: #8a8474;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .ph-blossom-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 288px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 128px;\n    height: 118px;\n  }\n  .ph-swallow {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 196px;\n    left: 288px;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 46px;\n  }\n  .ph-ducks {\n    width: 492px;\n    height: 110px;\n    margin: 10px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"unit-title\">古诗三首</div>\n\n  <div class=\"handwriting\">\n    1.三首古诗都要能背诵能默写；2.能翻译每句诗的意思；3.注释栏处的关键字词的意思都要掌握。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"red-frame\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-swallow\">[Illustration: 燕子, right of poem]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-blossom-left\">[Illustration: 桃花枝, left margin]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">绝 句</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">［唐］杜<ruby>甫<rt>fǔ</rt></ruby></div>\n\n      <div class=\"poem-body\">\n        迟日<sup>①</sup>江山丽，<br>\n        春风花草香。<br>\n        泥融<sup>②</sup>飞燕子，<br>\n        沙暖睡<ruby>鸳鸳<rt>yuān yāng</rt></ruby><sup>③</sup>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"poem-title2\"><ruby>惠崇<rt>huì chóng</rt></ruby>春江晚景<sup>①</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"author\">［宋］<ruby>苏 轼<rt>sū shì</rt></ruby></div>\n\n      <div class=\"poem-body\">\n        竹外桃花三两枝，<br>\n        春江水暖<ruby>鸭<rt>lóu hǎo</rt></ruby>先知。<br>\n        蒌蒿满地芦芽<sup>②</sup>短，<br>\n        正是河<ruby>豚<rt>tún</rt></ruby><sup>③</sup>欲上时。\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"note-box\">\n        <div class=\"nb-title\">注释</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>①［迟日］春天白天渐长，所以说“迟日”。</li>\n          <li>②［泥融］这里指泥土湿润。</li>\n          <li>③［鸳鸳］一种鸟，常在水边嬉戏，雄鸟与雌鸟常结对生活。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"keypoint\">重点</div>\n\n      <div class=\"note-box\">\n        <div class=\"nb-title\">注释</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>① 惠崇是北宋名僧，能诗善画。这首诗是苏轼为惠崇的画作《春江晚景》所写的题画诗。</li>\n          <li>②［芦芽］芦苇的嫩芽。</li>\n          <li>③［河豚］一种有毒的鱼。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bubble\">\n    我能猜出“蒌蒿”是一种植物，因为……\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-ducks\">[Illustration: 春江水面与鸭子, bottom of page]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-